{"3924200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Rat Eater", "steam_appid": 3924200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TRY Your Skill!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose your favorite playable rat and <strong>EAT</strong> your enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/15725bf9845deda3ba6c0454234ffa69.poster.avif?t=1787923749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/15725bf9845deda3ba6c0454234ffa69.webm?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/15725bf9845deda3ba6c0454234ffa69.mp4?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORE Rat Kingdom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Some places were sealed for a reason. <strong>Break in anyway</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take what isn’t yours after destroying those cheeky bastards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/98d2e8604730035c31f781bc5f84d161.poster.avif?t=1787923749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/98d2e8604730035c31f781bc5f84d161.webm?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/98d2e8604730035c31f781bc5f84d161.mp4?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CRAFT Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use whatever you manage to steal to <strong>craft</strong> powerful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/029f4c1677df94e41a3b83a8a2f5951f.poster.avif?t=1787923749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/029f4c1677df94e41a3b83a8a2f5951f.webm?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/029f4c1677df94e41a3b83a8a2f5951f.mp4?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Try your new powers in practice</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experiment where you shouldn’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">See what happens when the items you crafted start working together… in ways they were never meant to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/647fc46226c2685ce6267fabe6e4bdee.poster.avif?t=1787923749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/647fc46226c2685ce6267fabe6e4bdee.webm?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/647fc46226c2685ce6267fabe6e4bdee.mp4?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TRY Your Skill!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose your favorite playable rat and <strong>EAT</strong> your enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/15725bf9845deda3ba6c0454234ffa69.poster.avif?t=1787923749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/15725bf9845deda3ba6c0454234ffa69.webm?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/15725bf9845deda3ba6c0454234ffa69.mp4?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORE Rat Kingdom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Some places were sealed for a reason. <strong>Break in anyway</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take what isn’t yours after destroying those cheeky bastards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/98d2e8604730035c31f781bc5f84d161.poster.avif?t=1787923749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/98d2e8604730035c31f781bc5f84d161.webm?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/98d2e8604730035c31f781bc5f84d161.mp4?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CRAFT Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use whatever you manage to steal to <strong>craft</strong> powerful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/029f4c1677df94e41a3b83a8a2f5951f.poster.avif?t=1787923749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/029f4c1677df94e41a3b83a8a2f5951f.webm?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/029f4c1677df94e41a3b83a8a2f5951f.mp4?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Try your new powers in practice</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experiment where you shouldn’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">See what happens when the items you crafted start working together… in ways they were never meant to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/647fc46226c2685ce6267fabe6e4bdee.poster.avif?t=1787923749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/647fc46226c2685ce6267fabe6e4bdee.webm?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/extras/647fc46226c2685ce6267fabe6e4bdee.mp4?t=1787923749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Explore a randomly generated kingdom while discovering nearly endless possibilities of scroll crafting in this absurd roguelite. Loot power-ups, eat your enemies, and gamble whatever you can. Climb the leaderboards with your favorite character.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Best looking game i have ever seen”<br />\r\n10/10 – Rat Eater Graphic Designer<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“This game changed my life but i will give 5/10 because there is not enough feet to my liking”<br />\r\n5/10 – Jarosław K.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“Best game i have ever played, the designer must be really handsome”<br />\r\n10/10 – Rat Eater Game Designer<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/6bd996dc9ef5b290a8c933acbada5911c45933d1/header.jpg?t=1787923749", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/3ead8b34195bf3e7194a0d015966b79c981cfba3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787923749", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924200/3ead8b34195bf3e7194a0d015966b79c981cfba3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787923749", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 / AMD FX-8320<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 960 / R9 280<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F / AMD Ryzen 5 2500X <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong